# Root-level env example — for monorepo-wide variables (none yet).
#
# App-specific environment variables live in apps/mobile/:
#   apps/mobile/.env.development.example  →  copy to apps/mobile/.env.development
#   apps/mobile/.env.staging.example      →  copy to apps/mobile/.env.staging
#   apps/mobile/.env.production.example   →  copy to apps/mobile/.env.production
#
# All .env.* files are gitignored — never commit real credentials.
